    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solitaire for the cultured gamer in us all. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play against a selection of 2D girls, gradually stripping them of their clothes as you complete the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076950/extras/278377689ee9cd107401fe06fc460159.poster.avif?t=1733156064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076950/extras/278377689ee9cd107401fe06fc460159.webm?t=1733156064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076950/extras/278377689ee9cd107401fe06fc460159.mp4?t=1733156064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than just Klondike, we got Spider Solitaire and a few other gamemodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of girls to choose from with more on the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable difficulty modifiers for an easier or harder time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional abilities like Grand Reshuffle &amp; Pocket Space to prevent you from getting stuck or reaching an unwinnable state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whacky challenges like &quot;Opposite Day&quot; &amp; &quot;My Grampa's Deck Has No Pathetic Cards&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support &amp; Steam Deck Compatible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag, tap, and Auto-move card interaction supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boobs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Betsy</strong> - Cow girl</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Madeline</strong